<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the meeting, when the spirit’s rising high,</l><l>And it seems like we will go beyond the sky—</l><l>I can’t help it, I must speak or else I’ll die,</l><l>For my Christ is rising up to water you.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Should a pause come, or the meeting ebb real low,</l><l>While within me there’s a rich and living flow,</l><l>Then I’ll stand up, so that all the saints will know,</l><l>That I’m here to share my Christ and water you.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the church life, in our daily living too,</l><l>In the meeting, and in everything we do,</l><l>Christ is speaking and the Spirit’s breaking through,</l><l>That is why there’s the supply to water you.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
